- Line 64 — input: `{"realData":{"NCT00000001":{"nct":"NCT99999999","group":"drugalpha","tN":1,"cN":1,"pmid":"1"}}}` with `rv` selected in `fabrication_risk_scores.json`. Consequence: the validated key `NCT00000001` is overwritten by `t["nct"]`, so the instrument reads a name instead of its binding.

- Lines 52-64 and 249-263 — input: audit JSON has `"NCT00000001":{"group":"wrongdrug","pmid":"1"}` producing a NULL_PMID fix, while `rv.html` has `"NCT00000001":{"group":"rightdrug","pmid":"2"}`. Consequence: a verdict from the audit JSON copy is applied to a different HTML copy without checking the block still matches.

